64
00:04:30.437 --> 00:04:33.648
Syempre, hindi ko talaga sinasadya.

65
00:04:35.066 --> 00:04:37.027
Magiging asawa kita balang araw.

66
00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:41.406
nagtataka ako
kung pwede mong gampanan ang asawa ko.

67
00:04:41.698 --> 00:04:43.742
